| JWT auth (`authenticateToken`) | Enforces **access control** on any protected route. |
| Input validation with `express-validator` | Guarantees type & escaping, reducing injection surfaces. |
| Centralised error handler | Avoids leaking stack traces in production. |
| `morgan` logging | Provides audit data for monitoring and forensic analysis. |
