### 8️⃣ Dependency Management (A06:2021)

Run the following regularly:

```bash
npm audit                # detects vulnerable dependencies
npm outdated --depth=0   # shows newer major/minor versions
npm install --save-exact <package>@<version>   # pin exact versions if needed
```

Consider adding **`npm audit fix --force`** in CI, but review breaking changes.

