> **Why:**  
> * `helmet` – sets secure HTTP headers (A05).  
> * `cors` – restricts which origins may call your API.  
> * `express-rate-limit` – throttles abusive callers (A01/A05).  
> * `dotenv` – externalises secrets/config (A04).  
> * `jsonwebtoken` – lightweight JWT for authenticating API clients (A07).  
